    narr:narration """The architectural shift toward [Zypherion for analytics](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) is framed as a definitive, high-conviction decision. The justification rests on a specific performance benchmark, citing a [15x speed improvement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) for columnar queries, which serves as the primary technical driver for the transition. This decision is not presented as an ongoing exploration but as a [committed migration](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) scheduled for Q3 2026. The documentation of this shift is highly structured, utilizing [parallelized summary bullets](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) to align the [database choice](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [performance expectations](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [execution timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) into a singular, cohesive narrative of infrastructure modernization.""" ;
